opulsive action-adventure demands to be seen on the big screen.    \",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Our lives are the sum of our choices. Tom Cruise is Ethan Hunt in Mission: Impossible – The Final Reckoning.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"moderate violence, injury detail, threat, language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-21\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":170,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CUAQn2P13yY\",\"displayPriority\":4,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000029\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000030\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000031\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000436\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000802\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003183\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003189\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003192\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003193\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003194\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004434\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005130\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005592\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005596\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005686\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005717\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005718\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005719\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005720\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005721\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005722\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006663\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\"