            "text": "{\"businessDate\":\"2025-08-24\",\"showtimes\":[{\"id\":\"HOX1-22051\",\"schedule\":{\"businessDate\":\"2025-08-24\",\"startsAt\":\"2025-08-24T15:00:00+01:00\",\"endsAt\":\"2025-08-24T17:03:00+01:00\",\"filmStartsAt\":\"2025-08-24T15:25:00+01:00\",\"filmEndsAt\":\"2025-08-24T17:03:00+01:00\",\"inSeatItemDelivery\":null},\"isSoldOut\":false,\"seatLayoutId\":\"HOX1-1-7\",\"filmId\":\"HO00001735\",\"siteId\":\"HOX1\",\"screenId\":\"HOX1-1\",\"areaCategories\":[{\"areaCategoryId\":\"HOX1-0000000001\",\"isAllocatedSeating\":true}],\"attributeIds\":[\"0000000053\"],\"isAllocatedSeating\":true,\"requires3dGlasses\":false,\"eventId\":null,\"restrictions\":[\"FilmAdvanceBookingRule\"],\"filmAdvanceBookingRuleId\":\"HOX1-2-HO00001735\"}],\"relatedData\":{\"sites\":[{\"id\":\"HOX1\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Hoxton\",\"translations\":[]},\"location\":{\"latitude\":51.529,\"longitude\":-0.0837},\"contactDetails\":{\"phoneNumbers\":[],\"email\":\"\",\"address\":{\"line1\":\"55 Pitfield Street,\",\"line2\":\"London,\",\"city\":\"N1 6BU\"}},\"ianaTimeZoneName\":\"Europe/London\"}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"HO00001735\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Film Club: Beach Rats\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"On the outskirts of Brooklyn, Frankie, an aimless teenager, suffocates under the oppressive glare cast by his family and a toxic group of delinquent friends. Struggling with his own identity, Frankie begins to scour hookup sites for older men. When his chatting and webcamming intensify, he begins meeting men at a nearby cruising beach while simultaneously entering into a cautious relationship with a young woman. As Frankie struggles to reconcile his competing desires, his decisions leave him hurtling toward irreparable consequences. Eliza Hittman’s award-winning Sundance hit is a powerful character study that is as visually stunning as it is evocative.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"An aimless teenager on the outer edges of Brooklyn struggles 